  "content": "\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7afffd9e0be3c2c57cdf1e60c3d831827cd04798.png\"\n    alt=\"ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЬСКИЙ 3D МЕЧ\"\n    width=\"600\">\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<hr>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17aeebc13d1a3219e7e518d7a7f22a49446d7a4a_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"Описание\"\n    width=\"300\">\n</p>\n\n# Что входит в текстурпак\n\n- Алмазный меч\n- Железный меч\n- Золотой меч\n- Арбалет\n- Лук\n- Стрела\n- Арбалет с мультивыстрелом\n- Лук с мультивыстрелом\n\n<h1></h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/njE5mV4l/images/edbe6951aca2288727f5218d8671aa8b91fbfee3.webp\"\n    alt=\"ИЗОБРАЖЕНИЕ ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЬСКОГО 3D МЕЧА\"\n    style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto;\">\n</p>\n\n<h1></h1>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e812fd6e67e9eac3c00ba2bf16df1830cef91c82.png\"\n    alt=\"ТРЕБОВАНИЯ\"\n    width=\"320\">\n\n<p>Для корректной работы сущности стрелы данный текстурпак требует установки <strong>OptiFine</strong> или мода <strong>Entity Model Features</strong> для Fabric 1.21.X / Forge 1.21.X.</p>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KssS6VT.png\" width=\"100\" alt=\"EMF\">\n  </a>\n  \n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a84a822e69f5e42576ea0631129332b714a27a0a_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"ССЫЛКИ\"\n    width=\"170\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/custom-3d-sword\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com%2Ff%2F159648c2-8de7-4641-a129-8d8c2d06bd9c%2Fdee1zh0-f9e45f11-8ff2-4032-8215-72e54c647a9f.png%3Ftoken%3DeyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..fjO_Mm_jiHcc42PG-UJYYuQBR8JPs7bX9NCjPIfOD6g&n=-1\" width=\"70\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/custom-3d-sword-6423770\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flh7-rt.googleusercontent.com%2Fdocsz%2FAD_4nXdNMHQhEsV5eId8RgQzyG0GNxBl2Gpb7OQ0y300mcCgU03FMk2DHKoVTJtGA7DA0-KZUEbkNDBAB14my7CItBw_pz5hwycDcHVS7IUNMNY4n7ATuEpK1MDdtL34KEh7Vd3lQiFl%3Fkey%3DTs9sQSSfeNWwwKd7mSkTE4H1&n=-1\" width=\"70\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Drigo\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn2.steamgriddb.com/icon/46bbc4a56de136ad319e59e37ef55644/32/256x256.png\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drigo_\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://meta-q.cdn.bubble.io/f1718310734171x219118565666597060/64f1a9ddd0246590df69e9ef_ko-fi_logo_02.png\" width=\"70\" alt=\"Ko-fi\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
